21:24.440 --> 21:25.320
Ya.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.120
Cari rumah seperti saya gambarkan.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.120
Baiklah.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.960
Yuran pemprosesan ialah...

21:37.360 --> 21:38.560
200 ribu baht.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.280
Murah, bukan?

21:41.880 --> 21:42.760
Ya.

21:43.360 --> 21:46.240
Bayar tunai esok.

21:47.080 --> 21:48.160
Boleh?

21:56.280 --> 21:57.160
Okey.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.160
Mak.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.960
