30:12.360 --> 30:13.240
Ya.

30:18.800 --> 30:19.800
Jom makan.

30:21.240 --> 30:23.120
- Saya lapar.
- Ya, jom.

30:23.680 --> 30:25.360
Dapur di mana? Bawa saya.

30:31.160 --> 30:35.120
